 *
 * Each decorator implements Text, wraps ANOTHER Text passed to its
 * constructor, and changes the wrapped render() result:
 *   Upper   -> the wrapped result in upper case
 *   Exclaim -> the wrapped result with "!" appended
 *
 * Because every decorator both is-a Text and has-a Text, they can be
 * stacked in any order and to any depth.
 * The Text interface and PlainText class above are provided.
 *
 * Example:
